      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colton%2C_California",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1953, bulldozers razed much of historic downtown to make room for the Ramona Freeway, later renamed the San Bernardino Freeway.",
